# Web app (Next.js 16)

- Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` when using App Router APIs — differs from Next 14 training data.
- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when needed (hooks, events, browser APIs).
- Supabase: `createClient()` from `@/lib/supabase/server` in actions/RSC; `@/lib/supabase/client` in client components.
- Prefer existing UI in `components/ui/` before adding dependencies.
- Analytics: `trackEvent` from `@/lib/analytics` for user actions in rooms.
